hexagon-dsp-binaries
====================

hexagon-dsp-binaries is based on the upstream repo from the linux-msm project.
The project provides (semi-)monthly tagged releases and tarballs in the form of
YYYYMMDD.

Original files are not included into the Debian packaging repo. In order to
prepare for building the package:
0. Optionally run `dch -v 0~YYYYMMDD-1` in order to update to the new version,
1. run `uscan --download-current-version`,
2. run `debian/rules orig` in order to unpack the orig file into build tree,
3. run `debian/rules debian/control`.

Licences
--------

Upstream tracks all licensing information in the WHENCE file. Currently all
binary files are covered by one of the two licences which allow redistribution
of the files. Qualcomm DSP firmware in the linux-firmware repository is
covered by the same licence files.

